# A section of the library (docs/context/unifying-home-research-2026-11-22.md §11 and §12): the web
# pages kept, as notes of the web kind. Its ＋ asks for an address (`asks: [address]`): it opens a page
# or searches the web, the one box (Find or do), rather than making an empty note (2026-11-23).
key: web
label: Web
icon: globe
mark: ◎
purpose: Open a page, and the pages you kept
order: 15
page: /f/group/Web
types: [web]
views:
  - renderer: table
    columns: [source_url, tags]
  - renderer: gallery
new:
  asks: [address]
